The mills of Kinderdijk UNESCO World Heritage have been guarding us against the water for centuries. Now, you can boost that old technology with the latest innovations by downloading the free Kinderdijk app on your own smartphone. The app helps you make the most out of your visit. Explore the area, experience history, and learn all there is to know about our 19 windmills. With the app, you can buy boat tour and entry tickets, download the best audio tours, access a handy area map, and see exactly what is happening in and around Kinderdijk. The Kinderdijk app adds depth to your adventures below sea level!

The app contains:
-Short and extended audio tours for children and adults;
-Kinderdijk area map;
- Directions to Kinderdijk by Waterbus, car, or bicycle;
- Explore the area: further activities in and around Kinderdijk;
- Purchase boat tour and entry tickets;
- Information and images on special places in the windmill area;
- A treasure trove of practical information.

